      "start": {
        "title": "开始前，先知道三件事",
        "cards": [
          {
            "title": "学完能做什么",
            "text": "判断哪些规则该留在根目录，并写出一份简洁、不会拖累 AI 的 AGENTS.md。"
          },
          {
            "title": "需要准备什么",
            "text": "无需编程基础。只要能找到项目文件夹，并能用文本编辑器或 AI 编码工具创建文件即可。"
          },
          {
            "title": "遇到陌生词怎么办",
            "text": "点击正文中带虚线的术语，或随时使用右侧／底部的术语速查。"
          }
        ],
        "example": {
          "text": "This project is a web application.\nUse npm for dependencies.\nRun npm test before submitting changes.",
          "explanation": "中文学习辅助：它依次说明这是什么项目、使用什么依赖管理工具、提交前运行什么检查。它不是英文原文中的示例，也不要求你现在执行这些命令。"
        }
      },
      "check": {
        "title": "学完后，用一分钟自检",
        "items": [
          "我能解释为什么 AGENTS.md 不是越长越好。",
          "我能找出只在特定任务中使用的规则，并把它们移到单独文档。",
          "我能写出一份包含项目说明、必要工具和检查命令的最小文件。"
        ]
      },
      "originalExamples": [
        {
          "sourceId": "guide-source",
          "text": "```bash\n# Create a symlink from AGENTS.md to CLAUDE.md\nln -s AGENTS.md CLAUDE.md\n```"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "guide-source",
          "text": "```markdown\nThis is a React component library for accessible data visualization.\n```"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "guide-source",
          "text": "```markdown\nThis project uses pnpm workspaces.\n```"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "guide-source",
          "text": "```markdown\nAlways use const instead of let.\nNever use var.\nUse interface instead of type when possible.\nUse strict null checks.\n...\n```"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "guide-source",
          "text": "```markdown\nFor TypeScript conventions, see docs/TYPESCRIPT.md"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "guide-source",
          "text": "```\ndocs/\n├── TYPESCRIPT.md\n│   └── references TESTING.md\n├── TESTING.md\n│   └── references specific test runners\n└── BUILD.md\n    └── references esbuild configuration\n```"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "guide-source",
          "text": "```markdown\nThis is a monorepo containing web services and CLI tools.\nUse pnpm workspaces to manage dependencies.\nSee each package's AGENTS.md for specific guidelines.\n```"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "guide-source",
          "text": "```markdown\nThis package is a Node.js GraphQL API using Prisma.\nFollow docs/API_CONVENTIONS.md for API design patterns.\n```"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "guide-source",
          "text": "```txt\nI want you to refactor my AGENTS.md file to follow progressive disclosure principles.\n\nFollow these steps:\n\n1. **Find contradictions**: Identify any instructions that conflict with each other. For each contradiction, ask me which version I want to keep.\n\n2. **Identify the essentials**: Extract only what belongs in the root AGENTS.md:\n   - One-sentence project description\n   - Package manager (if not npm)\n   - Non-standard build/typecheck commands\n   - Anything truly relevant to every single task\n\n3. **Group the rest**: Organize remaining instructions into logical categories (e.g., TypeScript conventions, testing patterns, API design, Git workflow). For each group, create a separate markdown file.\n\n4. **Create the file structure**: Output:\n   - A minimal root AGENTS.md with markdown links to the separate files\n   - Each separate file with its relevant instructions\n   - A suggested docs/ folder structure\n\n5. **Flag for deletion**: Identify any instructions that are:\n   - Redundant (the agent already knows this)\n   - Too vague to be actionable\n   - Overly obvious (like \"write clean code\")\n```"
        }
      ],
      "originalExamplesInline": true,
